HeadPrimeAI.SkeletronPrime_Text: Don't try to kill me with this stupid thing! Die, organism!

MoonLordCoreAI: {
	MoonLordIntro_Text: The sun has gone out. That eye is watching you from across the whole sky.
	MoonLordCoreExposed_Text: All three eyes shattered, its heart bared to the starlight - now it holds nothing back.
}

PlanteraAI: {
	Plantera_Molt_Text: The husk splits. The jungle screams.
	Plantera_Wither_Text: The vines fall slack; its lights go out one by one.
}

CultistBossAI: {
	LunaticCultist_IntroText: The rite beneath the moon is not for mortal eyes.
	LunaticCultist_RitualBeginText: The cultists have ringed a summoning sigil - find the true one and break the chant.
	LunaticCultist_RitualCollapseText: The sigil shatters! The cultist staggers out of the rite.
	LunaticCultist_RitualPunishText: A false sacrifice feeds the ritual!
	LunaticCultist_MirrorPunishText: Wrong one - the phantom clenches lightning to strike back.
	LunaticCultist_MirrorRevealText: The true body stands revealed - the illusion crumbles!
	LunaticCultist_DeathText: The ritual was finished long ago... Raise your head. Look at the sky.
}

EowHeadAI.EowApex_Text: The ground beneath you splits into countless hungry maws...

SkeletronHeadAI: {
	Intro_Text: The old man's skin splits open. The curse opens its eyes.
	Unbound_Text: Skeletron snaps off its own hands.
	Day_Text: The dawn stings it. Run.
	Death_Text: The bells fall silent. The old man's curse is broken.
}

GolemBodyAI: {
	GolemAwaken_Text: The altar sinks; somewhere in the stone, gears begin to bite.
	GolemSunder_Text: The neck clamps burst open - the head rises, taking its halo with it.
	GolemOverdrive_Text: The sun core is overloading; light leaks from every seam in the stone.
	GolemCrumble_Text: The stone shell falls away, layer by layer, until only the gem still burns.
}

BrutalQueenBeeAI: {
	SwarmRage_Text: The swarm forms a living shield - the Queen is molting...
	RoyalTide_Text: The droning swells into thunder - the tide takes the shape of a lance!
}

DukeFishronAI: {
	DukeFishron_Frenzy_Text: The sea rises at his back.
	DukeFishron_Nightfall_Text: The sky goes dark. Something moves in the rain.
	DukeFishron_Maelstrom_Text: He clenches the whole storm into his fins.
	DukeFishron_Despawn_Text: The waves recede, and the sea closes over.
}

DeerclopsAI: {
	GazeWarn_Text: Avert your eyes!
	WhiteoutHint_Text: Stay close to it! Nothing can be seen beyond the blizzard
}

QueenSlimeAI: {
	QueenSlime_WingsText: The Queen Slime spreads her wings!
	QueenSlime_CathedralText: A crystal cathedral is taking shape!
}

EmpressOfLightAI: {
	EmpressDawn_Text: Dawn falls upon her - the hour of execution has come
	EmpressDusk_Text: She sheathes her radiance with the last ray of daylight
}

WallOfFleshAI: {
	WofIntroText: The horizon of hell is standing up...
	WofExodusText: The flesh is closing in ahead - there is no way out.
	CurtainDeathReason: "{0} was swallowed by the blood tide"
	NetDeathReason: "{0} was shredded by the net of the Hungry"
}

BrainOfCthulhuAI: {
	BrainIntro_Text: Your heartbeat has fallen into step with something else's.
	BrainPhase2_Text: The shell is broken. What was inside has not stopped.
	BrainHeartAttack_Text: The heartbeat stopped. Whose?
}

EyeOfCthulhuAI: {
	SkinTear_Text: The skin tears open—beneath it, a maw that has never once closed.
	Maelstrom_Text: The blood fog is drawing in—the maelstrom is about to open its eye.
}

KingSlimeAI: {
	PhaseShift_Text: The crown lifts off, and the gel begins to boil!
	NinjaFreed_Text: A figure struggles free of the slumping gel and vanishes across the fields without looking back.
}
